{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-q2-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso Luxe Q2 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Vaporesso LUXE Q2 Pod System, offering a 1000mAh battery, intelligent wattage selection, and compatible with the LUXE Q Pods to deliver pure flavor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-q-replacement-pods\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe Q Replacement Pods\" style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003eVaporesso LUXE Q Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the Luxe Q2 Pod System is wrapped in faux leather to give a luxurious look and feel, elevating the Vaporesso Luxe Q2 Pod System. Adopting the AXON chipset for instantaneous heating and improved functionality, the Luxe Q2 Kit is perfect for those looking for a reliable vaping pod system. Powered by a 1000mAh battery, the Luxe Q2 is ideal, lasting throughout the day and accepting recharges through the Type-C port.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVaporesso LUXE Q2 Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 96.8mm by 26mm by 18.6mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Zinc-Alloy \u0026amp; Leather\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow - MTL \/ DTL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: LUXE Q\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstruction: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill-System: Side Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: 0.6ohm, 0.8ohm, 1.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Integrated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAXON Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp